    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "common_0225_sitappa_a_04",
      "hash64": "37B17E2F7B0431DC",
      "text": "知道還用那種態度？\\n不是說只要進了天星隊，大家就會怕我，\\r\\n從此一步登天嗎？[VAR 0x0114(002D)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
