    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "common_0225_sitappa_a_05",
      "hash64": "37B17F2F7B04338F",
      "text": "怎麼連[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳也……\\n人家我可是特地加入天星隊的，\\r\\n這待遇，根本就是最底層的小角色嘛。[VAR 0x0114(002D)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 3,
