      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "common_0225_sitappa_b_06",
      "hash64": "0EE6023AC5DDA359",
      "text": "既然如此，只能由我這個前輩\\n去教訓這傢伙了嗎……！？[VAR 0x0114(002E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
