      "ordinal": 34,
      "label": "common_0225_rival_09",
      "hash64": "B93CA21B98593655",
      "text": "試試就知道了！一邊對戰，\\n一邊去了解怎麼用它吧～！[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
