    {
      "ordinal": 35,
      "label": "common_0225_sitappa_b_09",
      "hash64": "0EE60B3AC5DDB2A4",
      "text": "咦？看這發展，\\n我是要被[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳們用來試太晶珠的嗎……？[VAR 0x0114(002E)]",
